      "scene_type": "gritwerk_paper",
      "duration_hint": 16,
      "spoken": "Researchers led by David Neal gave moviegoers fresh or stale popcorn. People who habitually ate popcorn at the movies ate the stale kind too, no matter how it tasted. But only in the cinema, and only with their usual hand.",
