      "function": "insight",
      "scene_type": "gritwerk_paper",
      "duration_hint": 16,
      "spoken": "A review puts it this way: changing habits rarely fails for lack of willpower, but because cues around us trigger them automatically. Change the cues and you disrupt the trigger. The study used popcorn, the phone is our own transfer.",
